        "referenceAnswer": "void Deleteallx(Lnode *&head, int x){\n    Lnode *pr = head, *p = head->next;\n    while (p != head) {\n        if (p->data == x) {\n            pr->next = p->next;\n            delete p;\n            p = pr->next;\n        } else {\n            pr = p;\n            p = p->next;\n        }\n    }\n}"
